{
  "$comment": "Design system of the AGNOS presentation website, a layer over agnos-perf-center/assets/tokens.json (FTR-WEB-001: RQ-WEB-008, RQ-WEB-014, RQ-WEB-015; ADR-WEB-001: DEC-WEB-005; ADR-TRC-002). Same three tiers: global holds the only raw values; semantic names a role and refers to a global token of either file, per theme when it is a colour; component refers to a semantic token of either file. Every name starts with web so that none repeats a Performance Center token. The page uses the Performance Center's surfaces, texts, accent, identities (kind-human, kind-agent), brand and weights directly; this layer adds the site's fonts (IBM Plex, the mock-up's of 2026-11-08), its type and spacing scales, the dark band of the close and the soft identity backgrounds of the chain card. The mock-up's half-pixel sizes (10.5, 11.5, 12.5, 13.5, 19 and 21 px) are rounded to the nearest step of the scale. The sample-* tokens repeat, in both themes, the resolved values of Roombook's button tokens (agnos-lightweight-process.demo, client/design/tokens.json, FTR-DSN-001), shown by the design-system card (RQ-WEB-018); a test compares them with the demo's file.",
